DialCallStatus: ${$json.dialCallStatus}
CallSid: ${$json.callSid}
Caller: ${$json.callerNumber}
Called number: ${$json.calledNumber}
Dial duration: ${$json.dialCallDuration}

Check the Vapi SIP trunking config and n8n execution logs for this CallSid if this keeps happening.` }) }}

